// A zero-width guard for the mixed subscript below: do the brackets AHEAD hold both a
// depth-0 comma and a depth-0 colon? That is exactly the shape neither SliceSfx (which
// takes no comma) nor IndexSfx (which takes no colon) can parse, so gating the mixed
// form on it leaves `a[1:2]`, `a[::2]` and `a[0, 1]` on the paths they already had.
// The scan skips string literals whole (their contents are not brackets), tracks the
