// { e for x in it [if c] } / { a, b, ... } (SetComp / SetLit below): a genuine set - a
// dict whose keys are the members (so membership, len and insertion order come for free)
// marked __set.
// ( e for x in it [if c] ): a parenthesized generator expression.
GenExpParen <~~ push(makeListComp(takeAll())) ~~>
