    // CPython's arity errors, in the wording of each calling convention: a method
    // with no parameters, a single-argument one, and Argument Clinic's
    // positional-only ("expected at least") and keyword-capable ("takes at most")
    // forms. format takes any number.
    function pySArity(name, n) {
